{"family":"blood-circulation","title":"血液循环线路图","subtitle":"正常成人血流的教学简图 · 观察者左侧对应人体右侧，颜色表示相对氧合状态。","context":"normal-adult-human","stations":[{"id":"ra","oxygen":"low","note":null},{"id":"rv","oxygen":"low","note":null},{"id":"la","oxygen":"high","note":null},{"id":"lv","oxygen":"high","note":null},{"id":"pa","oxygen":"low","note":"离开心脏，含氧较少"},{"id":"lung","oxygen":"low-to-high","note":"气体交换：血液获得氧"},{"id":"pv","oxygen":"high","note":"回到心脏，含氧较丰富"},{"id":"aorta","oxygen":"high","note":"离开心脏，含氧较丰富"},{"id":"body","oxygen":"high-to-low","note":"组织取用氧，血液含氧降低"},{"id":"cava","oxygen":"low","note":"回到心脏，含氧较少"}],"routes":[{"circuit":"pulmonary","stations":["rv","pa","lung","pv","la"]},{"circuit":"systemic","stations":["lv","aorta","body","cava","ra"]}],"heartLinks":[{"from":"ra","to":"rv"},{"from":"la","to":"lv"}],"note":"红蓝为教学配色，并非血液的真实颜色；站距不表示长度、时间或流量。本图省略冠状循环、半月瓣和真实解剖形态。"}
